cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Papers in Order: Computer Science Research Paper Roadmaps"
message: "If you reference this resource in academic work, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "Papers in Order Contributors"
    website: "https://github.com/Achal13jain/cs-paper-roadmaps"
abstract: >-
  Twelve curated, logically ordered reading paths through landmark papers in
  modern computing, sequenced by conceptual dependency with TL;DRs,
  prerequisites, and key takeaways. Covers LLMs,
  Computer Vision, Reinforcement Learning, Distributed Systems, Graph Neural
  Networks, Database Systems, Cryptography, Information Retrieval, Computer
  Architecture, Computational Biology, Programming Languages, and Machine
  Learning Systems. 291 papers across 12 fields.
keywords:
  - reading-list
  - computer-science
  - machine-learning
  - paper-curation
  - bibliography
  - research-roadmap
